notes:        Lumetri Scopes on the graded dunes frame: an RGB parade and a luma waveform, labelled Rec. 709 with Clamp Signal and 8 Bit, computed from the frame FilmSweet composited in linear light. 527x453 crop. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
